      "E": {
        "slot": "E",
        "id": "SeraphineE",
        "name": "增幅节拍",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "萨勒芬妮对一条直线上的敌人们造成伤害和移动受损效果。",
        "bodyHtml": "萨勒芬妮释放出一道强力音波，对一条直线上的敌人造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/100/130/160/190 + ([[si:scaleap]]50% 法术强度))魔法伤害</span>和持续1.1/1.2/1.3/1.4/1.5秒的99%<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">减速</span>效果。<br /><br />对已被<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">减速</span>的敌人们造成<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">禁锢</span>效果，对已被<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">定身</span>的敌人们造成<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">晕眩</span>效果。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">对小兵造成70%伤害。</span>",
